  "src": "本地实测：npx cds-serve + curl（@sap/cds 9.9.3, Node v22.23.2）",
  "caption": "本地 mocked 实测：匿名 401、alice 200、未配置的用户 zoe 也 200 —— mocked 的密码与用户名都不校验",
  "lh": 20,
  "lines": [
    "$ npx cds-serve --port 4123            # package.json: cds.requires.auth.kind = mocked",
    "[cds] - serving BookOrderService { at: '/odata/v4/book-order' }",
    "$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' localhost:4123/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders",
    "401",
    "$ curl -s -u alice:alice -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' \"localhost:4123/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders?\\$top=1\"",
    "200",
    "$ curl -s -u zoe:pw      -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' \"localhost:4123/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders?\\$top=1\"",
    "200",
    "# zoe 并没有配置在 cds.requires.auth.users 里 —— mocked 仍然放行",
    "$ curl -s -u alice:wrong -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' localhost:4123/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders",
    "200",
    "# 默认 mock 用户（alice/bob/...）没有配密码，所以密码也不校验",
    "$ curl -s localhost:4123/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders | head -c 60",
    "{\"@odata.context\":\"$metadata#BookOrders\",\"value\":[{\"createdAt\":\"2026-",
    "",
    "# 结论：mocked 只验证「请求带没带 Basic 头」，不验证「这个人是谁」"
  ],
